  "caption_en": "Figure 15. Unfiltered whole-trial angular-velocity spectra from all 72 frozen synthetic tracking trials. Each curve is the descriptive arithmetic mean of nine trial PSDs (three fixed path geometries \u00d7 three reused noise seeds) for one method and plant condition; curves are not confidence intervals or nine IID route samples. Welch parameters: Fs=20 Hz, Hann window, 128 samples per segment, 64-sample overlap, 256-point FFT, constant detrending per segment, one-sided density scaling, and mean segment averaging. The dotted line marks 2 Hz. Whole continuous trials include startup and turning transients and have unequal durations; phases are never concatenated. Nonpositive PSD values are masked on the logarithmic axis without a pseudocount. The command clock is t\u22120.05 s and the body clock is t; this constant offset does not change magnitude PSD. Synthetic localization perturbations enter controller observations, not the saved true body-state trace directly. No FAST-LIO/NDT execution or real actuator identification is represented.",
